---
title: Discover, unlock, equip
pageSlug: the-loop
mod: spell-codex
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

The Codex loop is always the same:

1. **Discover** spells into your Codex (from Iron’s base schools and compatible school addons).
2. Open the Codex with the [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar) key.
3. Select matching **ink**, then press **+** to unlock the next tier.
4. Click an unlocked spell, choose a tier if asked, and place it on the action bar.
5. Cast from the action bar only.

School tabs, discovery progress bars, and horizontal scrolling help when you have wide books or many schools. Use **Edit HUD** in the Codex to reposition the action bar, mana group, and cast/charge bar. The action bar HUD stays hidden until at least one spell is equipped.
